<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>동의 수신자 Excel 등록</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/resources/css/app.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/resources/css/admin-data.css?v=20260908-1"></head><body class="admin-body"><jsp:include page="/WEB-INF/jsp/fragments/admin/header.jsp"/><div class="admin-layout"><jsp:include page="/WEB-INF/jsp/fragments/admin/sidebar.jsp"/><main class="admin-main"><div class="page-heading-row"><div><p class="section-kicker">RECIPIENT IMPORT</p><h1>동의 수신자 Excel 등록</h1><p>.xlsx 5MB 이하, 수신자 소속기관·수신자 직책·이름·이메일·수신자 정보 등록 근거를 최대 1,000명까지 검증 후 등록합니다. 소속기관과 직책은 선택 입력입니다.</p></div><a class="secondary-button download-template-button excel-download-button" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/admin/recipients/import/template" download="recipient-import-template.xlsx" data-template-download><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14 3H5a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v16a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h10M14 3l5 5h-5V3Z"/><path d="M7 10h4M7 14h4M7 18h4M19 12v8m-3-3 3 3 3-3"/></svg><span data-download-label>양식 다운로드</span></a></div><c:if test="${not empty error}"><p class="alert alert-error" role="alert"><c:out value="${error}"/></p></c:if><section class="work-panel"><c:if test="${clamAvDisabled}"><p class="alert">로컬 개발환경에서는 ClamAV 검사가 비활성화되어 있습니다. 운영 활성화 시 검사 실패 파일은 반입되지 않습니다.</p></c:if><form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="data-form"><input type="hidden" name="${_csrf.parameterName}" value="${_csrf.token}"><div class="form-field"><label for="organizationUnitDisplay">관리 기관</label><input id="organizationUnitDisplay" type="text" value="${institutionName}" readonly aria-readonly="true"/></div><div class="form-field"><label for="file">Excel 파일</label><div class="file-upload-control"><input class="file-upload-input" id="file" name="file" type="file" accept=".xlsx,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet" required><label class="file-upload-button" for="file"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 16V4m0 0L7.5 8.5M12 4l4.5 4.5M5 15.5V19h14v-3.5"/></svg><span>Excel 파일 선택</span></label><span class="file-upload-name" id="file-name" aria-live="polite">선택된 파일 없음</span></div><p class="file-upload-help">.xlsx 파일만 등록할 수 있으며, 최대 용량은 5MB입니다.</p></div><div class="form-actions"><a class="secondary-button" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/admin/recipients">취소</a><button class="primary-button">검증하기</button></div></form></section></main></div><script defer src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/resources/js/file-upload.js?v=20260827-1"></script><script defer src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/resources/js/template-download.js?v=20260929-1"></script></body></html>
